# SHA-256 of the tools `cargo tauri build` downloads for the AppImage (x86_64),
# from the URLs hardcoded in tauri-bundler's linux/appimage/linuxdeploy.rs, and
# the name it caches each under in ~/.cache/tauri. Tauri checks no hash and
# skips a download when the file is already there; companion-release.yml puts
# these exact bytes there first. After bumping tauri-cli, update these from the
# new URLs and names.
